{% doc %}
  Emits one seasonal box as a JSON object for `window.AVADA_JW.bundles`.

  Extracted so the section can build that list from either source without keeping two
  copies of these fields in sync: the curated box collections (no lookup limit), or the
  legacy `all_products[handle]` path kept for themes configured before the collection
  picker existed.

  Writes no separator — the caller decides where commas go.

  @param {product} product - the box product, already resolved
  @param {string} plan_group_id - app plan group id from the section settings; blank
    sends every group the product carries
  @example
  {% render 'joy-subscription-bundle-json', product: p, plan_group_id: plan_group_id %}
{% enddoc %}
{
  "productId": {{ product.id | json }},
  "handle": {{ product.handle | json }},
  "title": {{ product.title | json }},
  {%- comment -%}
    variantId is what /cart/add.js actually needs. Without it getBundleVariantId()
    returns null, buildBundleSelections() drops EVERY box, and the cart silently gets no
    subscription line at all (which also nulls pickStapleSellingPlanId, so staples lose
    __staple).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  "variantId": {{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id | json }},
  "vendor": {{ product.vendor | json }},
  "image": {{ product.featured_image | json }},
  "price": {{ product.price | json }},
  "compare_at_price": {{ product.compare_at_price | json }},
  "available": {{ product.available | json }},
  "selling_plan_groups": {{ product.selling_plan_groups | json }},
  {%- comment -%}
    App-side plan data (discount + tier). AVADA_SUBSCRIPTION cannot supply this on a page
    template — it reads `product.metafields` and a page has no product context, so its
    `subscriptionPlans` is always []. Here we DO have a product per box.

    `.value` is REQUIRED to index into a JSON metafield: `data` is a Metafield object, so
    `data[id]` silently returns nil (printing it raw works, indexing it does not).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign plan_all = product.metafields.avada_subscription_plan_v2.data.value -%}
  {%- if plan_group_id != blank and plan_all != blank -%}
    {%- assign plan_picked = plan_all[plan_group_id] -%}
    "plan_v2": {%- if plan_picked -%}{ {{ plan_group_id | json }}: {{ plan_picked | json }} }{%- else -%}false{%- endif -%}
  {%- else -%}
    "plan_v2": {{ plan_all | default: false }}
  {%- endif -%}
}
